{"v":4,"catch":"通過成為可愛的兔子展開冒險來拯救你的家人。","desc":"收集漿果，找到帶有獎勵的秘密，向敵人扔擲物品或跳到他們身上來獲勝。找到秘密星星並更換服裝。擊敗老闆並到達最後一個以拯救小兔子免於囚禁。探索綠色田野、洞穴、河流、雪山、冰湖、沙漠和遺跡。\n\n特點:\n- 12個不同的關卡\n- 8種敵人\n- 10種服裝（不包括標準服裝）\n- 大量秘密\n- 跑步、跳躍、游泳、滑冰","publisher":"Sometimes You","release":"2025-02-27","genres":["街機","益智"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.3GB / Switch 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a3c61b0529e0ef3ea20e44e9128c030ac7966e33502d5f5a74ab0e32cbf7d6a2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/26c33558840995f571e6e95ba7bdfd22ef6ea5cab7ae05fda75548d8f2f60e0e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fa0625d05549a9f2ed96320321a8fb1480e594e054133231f7baa58b702d14e2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d3be62e2ce4e6134a381c0b303748a7f25abd3732a7ace9fbbd33f2830da513a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f0897b34c9f3a86b489072c54b975b4a4284322b615c67a1c2d624e4d7398577.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/edff3479aa621921fcc4a39a595bde0a1269eea7386d49a16ee45d32aaf9dd4a.jpg"],"titleId":"010055801fb14000","dlc":[]}